Subject: [PATCH] Add ADR-012: Organization Domain (architecture decision)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Establishes Organization as a first-class peer domain (not Configuration),
with three adopted aggregates — OrgUnit (recursive, typed), Location, and
effective-dated Assignment — and Legal Entity intentionally deferred until a
Payroll/multi-country consumer exists. Records the single-parent-tree
decision (matrix modeled separately), the invariant that organizational
placement belongs to effective-dated Assignment resolvable as-of a date (not
to Employee), reuse of the platform's audit/outbox/effective-dating primitives
with no custom temporal engine, the integration boundaries, the
adjacency-now/derived-read-models-later performance philosophy, the explicit
rejections, and the enduring architectural invariants. Architecture decision
only — no code, schema, migration, or task. Foundation for Epic 7B.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
